# Trivy vulnerability ignore list (baseline).
#
# The container scan hard-fails the build on HIGH/CRITICAL findings that HAVE a
# fix available (ignore-unfixed: true). Anything listed here is a documented,
# reviewed exception.
#
# Rules:
#   * One CVE id per line.
#   * ALWAYS add a comment: why it's accepted + an expiry date to force review.
#   * Prefer fixing (a rebuild picks up patched packages) over ignoring.
#
# Example:
#   # CVE-2024-12345: no upstream fix in Alpine yet; not reachable in this image.
#   # Re-review by: 2026-09-01
#   CVE-2024-12345
#
# --- baseline is intentionally empty ---
